  "description": "Bring a festive and personalized Christmas vibe to your craft projects with our 8 Christmas Custom Name Ornament Laser Cut Bundle! This premium bundle includes 8 unique custom name Christmas ornament designs, perfect for personalization, holiday gifts, Christmas decorations, and DIY projects. Ideal for laser cutting, CNC machines, Cricut, Silhouette, and a wide range of creative ornament, home décor, gift, and Christmas-themed craft projects.\nEach design is carefully crafted for clean, smooth cuts and delivers beautiful results on wood, acrylic, MDF, cardstock, leather, and more.\nWhat you’ll get (High-Quality Formats):\n8 SVG – scalable & cutting machine-ready\n8 EPS – professional vector format\n8 PNG – 300 DPI high-resolution\n8 DXF – compatible with laser cutting machines\n8 PDF – easy to print & preview\n8 AI – fully editable in Adobe Illustrator\nPerfect for:\nPersonalized Christmas ornaments, custom name decorations, holiday gifts, Christmas tree ornaments, family name signs, stocking tags, gift tags, home décor, craft fairs, DIY Christmas projects, small business products, and creative handmade crafts.\nThank you for visiting our store!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring a festive and personalized Christmas vibe to your craft projects with our 8 Christmas Custom Name Ornament Laser Cut Bundle! This premium bundle includes 8 unique custom name Christmas ornament designs, perfect for personalization, holiday gifts, Christmas decorations, and DIY projects. Ideal for laser cutting, CNC machines, Cricut, Silhouette, and a wide range of creative ornament, home décor, gift, and Christmas-themed craft projects.</p>\n<p>Each design is carefully crafted for clean, smooth cuts and delivers beautiful results on wood, acrylic, MDF, cardstock, leather, and more.</p>\n<p>What you’ll get (High-Quality Formats):</p>\n<p>8 SVG – scalable &amp; cutting machine-ready<br>\n8 EPS – professional vector format<br>\n8 PNG – 300 DPI high-resolution<br>\n8 DXF – compatible with laser cutting machines<br>\n8 PDF – easy to print &amp; preview<br>\n8 AI – fully editable in Adobe Illustrator</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<p>Personalized Christmas ornaments, custom name decorations, holiday gifts, Christmas tree ornaments, family name signs, stocking tags, gift tags, home décor, craft fairs, DIY Christmas projects, small business products, and creative handmade crafts.</p>\n<p>Thank you for visiting our store!</p>",
